With `nargs`, the split values fill the tuple in order:

```{eval-rst}
.. click:example::

    from collections import Sequence

    @click.command()
    @click.option('--point', envvar='POINT', nargs=2, type=float)
    def plot(point):
        if isinstance(point, Sequence):
            x, y = point
            click.echo(f"x={x} y={y}")

.. click:run::

    invoke(plot, env={"POINT": "1.5 2.5"})
```
